Farmers tipped a ton of snow on Espa.
Helsinki's EU summit in 1999 also prompted farmers to protest and burn hay bales in front of the meeting venue.
Nurses went on strike in 1983 and 1995
Nurses went on strike for about a month in 1995.
The last time they went on strike was in 1983.
The 1995 strike was coloured by a few deaths that took place during the strike.
Tehy threatened a strike and mass resignations of nurses in 2007.
Threat of mass resignation finally accelerated the negotiations to the result.
Doctors went on strike in 2001
"Doctors on strike - out of necessity," was the slogan of striking physicians in 2001.
The strike by municipal health centre and hospital doctors lasted about five months and prompted a lively discussion about how strikes can endanger patient safety.
