Kauhajoki magazine: A complaint to the Chancellor of Justice about the establishment of Kauhava Reception Centre
The Finnish Immigration Service and the Finnish Red Cross (SPR) are collaboratively establishing a refugee reception centre in the Kauhava ex-garrison, currently owned by LSK Business Park Oy.
According to the complaint, the area is still permanently based on critical infrastructure during the crisis period, which is used by the Defence Forces and its collaborator, Suomen Erillisverkot Oy.
