It's the fact that you're fighting down the street at all.
You make the lives of so many other immigrants more difficult here in Finland, Amirkhani from Turku reminds.
Amirkhani reminds us that there are sites in Finland that are looking for crimes committed by immigrants.
There have been so many individual incidents.
