Zotov has since made every effort to deny the information.
He even posted a picture on his own public Facebook page, in which he seems to peek through an armoured vehicle's hatch in a very good mood, and at least based on those pictures, it's not about getting stuck or angry.
Total nonsense.
Let's start with the fact that I didn't go into the battle tank, it was an assault tank BMP-3.
I'm a former soldier myself, Lieutenant Colonel, I've served in the Urals.
“I went inside, looked around and came out in peace,” Zotov told Komosomolskaya Pravda.
“I didn’t get stuck and I certainly didn’t spend five hours in that position,” he said.
