That's why I was interested in what's inside the wagons, I admired our technique.
And I came out through the trunk, he said.
I went to all the tanks.
And even in the next exhibition I will definitely visit all the tanks and all assault tanks, Zotov promised.
Zotov also called the reporter who wrote about it a fool.
One fool wrote and everyone else repeated.
There wasn't anything like that.
I went in and I came out.
